          "Example Company X owns 40% of the voting power in Company Y and Company Z owns the balance 60% Company Z has entered into an agreement with Company X such that Company Z will exercise its voting power in the way Company X wants Therefore, in accordance with this agreement it is Company X that has control over Company Y not Company Z"
