          "Question ABC acquired 75% of the USD20 million stated capital of Y Ltd on 31stDec 2008. The summarised statements of profit or loss of the two companies for the year ending 31 December 2010 are set out below Statement of profit or loss for the year ended 31st Dec 2010 Prepare the consolidated statement of profit or loss for the year ended 31stDec 2010"
